Third-party files

The 17 .pdc files in workers/polarfire-hybrid-control/libero/constraints/icicle_reference/ are copied from Microchip's PolarFire SoC Icicle Kit reference design (https://github.com/polarfire-soc/icicle-kit-reference-design, commit fd0aebb). They remain under that project's license, the MIT license; a copy is in that folder as LICENSE.md.

Tool output not covered by the license

Files in workers/polarfire-hybrid-control/libero/reports/ and archive/v0/tychon-polarfire-control/libero/reports/ that were produced by Microchip Libero SoC (including SmartTime and SmartPower) or Synopsys Synplify Pro are tool output. They are not covered by the Apache-2.0 license in LICENSE, whether or not they carry a tool banner or appear in the list below. This output includes logs, reports, CSV exports and SmartPower .spw files. The scripts, notes and measurement files written for this project in those folders are covered by the license.

